															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drannoyingdog" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2425082); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2425082&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607200863" alt="DrAnnoyingDog" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2425082)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drannoyingdog" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2425082); return false;" >DrAnnoyingDog</a></span> <span class="odate time_1547129871 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">10 Jan 2019 14:17</span>
