			<div class="content" id="post-content-4114743">
									

<p>This is a collaboration between <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rounderhouse" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4187885); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4187885&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1547162968" alt="Rounderhouse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4187885)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rounderhouse" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4187885); return false;">Rounderhouse</a></span> and myself for Cliche Con 2019. Our entry uses an anomaly cliche: Compulsion, and a story element cliche: PoI gets one up on the Foundation.</p>
<p>So, this is my first scip! Which means I'm a real author now. Now rounder can stop yelling at me. Speaking of rounder, this wouldn't be a thing without him! He did most of the work, and I'm taking the credit! I'm just joking, this is a mutual credit-taking.</p>
<p>Thanks to everyone who critiqued this!</p>
